#: includes/viewmodels/class-selftest-viewmodel.php:54
msgid "A new visitor gets a captcha. After solving it, the site opens."
msgstr "מבקר חדש מקבל Captcha. לאחר שפותר אותו, ה-אתר נפתח."

#: includes/viewmodels/class-selftest-viewmodel.php:55
msgid "A new visitor gets a captcha. Solve it in the window on the right to finish the test."
